{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hear this, O priests</b> — also <b>give ear, O house of Israel</b> [means] those whom I reproved, or 'the house of Israel' is the Sanhedrin." "<b>and the king's house, give ear</b> — for all of them are judges." "<b>for a snare you have been to Mizpah</b> — that you do not allow the pilgrims to go up to the house of HaShem."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:13.083138332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}